.\" Begin generated content:
.TH "FUMON" "1" "2026\-08\-24"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
\fBFUMon\fR \- Failed Units Monitor.\&
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBfumon\fR
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
Watches for user units entering failed state, sends notifications via
\fBnotify\-send\fR.\&
.PP
Service is managed by user unit \fBfumon.\&service\fR, wanted by
\fBgraphical\-session.\&target\fR.\&
.PP
If it is not enabled by default, enable and start it with:
.PP
.RS 4
\fBsystemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now fumon.\&service\fR
.PP
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBbusctl\fR(1), \fBnotify\-send\fR(1), \fBuwsm\fR(1)
